### Why This Question Is Asked

This question evaluates practical understanding of multi-channel message delivery with per-tenant isolation and delivery guarantees. It assesses the ability to design comprehensive test coverage for idempotency, credential revocation, and regional resilience under realistic failure modes.

### Key Concepts

- Multi-channel delivery (APNs, FCM)
- Idempotency and replay safety
